TRAINING IS REQUIRED

I want to be clear on this one. This training is a key competency for your role. If you haven't completed it by 14 November, you won't be able to be rostered on for shifts until it's done.

If you can't make the sessions, please contact Dave as early as you can and he'll work with you on alternate arrangements. We want everyone on the roster this season, and we'll work with you to get there.

